[00:00.0 --> 00:03.0]
WhatsApp Cloud API and Twilio phone -- your humanoid reaches everyone's pocket.

[00:03.0 --> 00:10.0]
Launch rysh. WhatsApp uses the Cloud API; phone uses Twilio. Both go in the contacts block of the skill file.

[00:10.0 --> 00:24.0]
WhatsApp needs a phone, an api_key, and a business_id. Phone needs a number, the provider twilio, an account_sid, and an auth_token -- every secret pulled in with the ENV_VAR syntax.

[00:24.0 --> 00:33.0]
Double-Escape into rysh mode, spawn the humanoid, then start the WhatsApp channel.

[00:33.0 --> 00:40.0]
Start the phone channel the same way -- name, then the channel type.

[00:40.0 --> 00:45.0]
##humanoid channels support lists both channels, now live.

